#!/usr/bin/env bash
# ^^^ for syntax checking in the editor only

##
## LocalTools.ManagerInterface.include -- the console interface settings of the manager screen, `.local`'s own:
## the style it is drawn in, its mouse and the spacers of its lists, saved for the user who runs it. Declared here,
## in the one place; the settings digest of the agents console (AgentsTools.ManagerConfig.include) expands these
## rows into its `interface` subject, which the settings screen shows and `--manager-config-set` saves a change by.
## A row keeps the form THE LABELS and THE CHANGEABLE SETTINGS of that file give: labels, settings, former names.
##

## THE LABELS of the interface settings, `<subject>|<group>|<key>|<label>|<belongs>|<description>`.
localManagerInterfaceLabels="interface|||Interface Settings||
interface|style||Screen Style||
interface|style|MDLT_MANAGER_STYLE|Interface Style|settings|How the manager screen is drawn: its windows, its frames and its colours. A change is the look of the screen at its next start, for this user in this workspace.
interface|mouse||Mouse Support||
interface|mouse|MDLT_MANAGER_MOUSE|Mouse Support|settings|Whether the manager screen takes the mouse. Disabled, the mouse is left to the terminal, whose own selection then copies text. A change is read by the screen at its next start, for this user.
interface|spacers||List Spacers||
interface|spacers|MDLT_MANAGER_SPACERS|List Spacers|settings|Whether the lists of the manager screen keep a blank line between their groups. Disabled, they do not. A change is read by the screen at its next start, for this user."

## THE CHANGEABLE SETTINGS of the interface, in the order the settings screen offers them,
## `<subject>|<group>|<key>|<kind>|<places>|<default>|<takes>`. The style's values are the styles and the
## colours the screen declares (STYLES and COLOURS in AgentsManagerScreen.py, which AgentsManagerConfigInterfaceCheck
## holds against this row).
localManagerInterfaceSettings="interface|style|MDLT_MANAGER_STYLE|choice|environment user|tv-system|nu-system=Magic - System,nu-blue=Magic - Dark/Blue,nu-gray=Magic - Light/Gray,tv-system=Turbo Vision - System,tv-blue=Turbo Vision - Dark/Blue,tv-gray=Turbo Vision - Light/Gray,bw-system=Basic B/W - System,bw-dark=Basic B/W - Dark/Blue,bw-light=Basic B/W - Light/Gray
interface|mouse|MDLT_MANAGER_MOUSE|choice|user system||=Enabled,disable=Disabled
interface|spacers|MDLT_MANAGER_SPACERS|choice|user system||=Enabled,disable=Disabled"

## THE OTHER NAMES of a value of the style: a style alone, from before a style had its colours, each the
## one it was drawn in then (the screen's STYLES "bare"), Magic by its name of then; and the colours of
## Turbo Vision and of Magic by the names of every style, dark for blue and light for gray (the screen's COLOURS).
localManagerInterfaceFormer="MDLT_MANAGER_STYLE|tv=tv-system,bw=bw-system,magic=nu-gray,tv-dark=tv-blue,tv-light=tv-gray,nu-dark=nu-blue,nu-light=nu-gray,magic-system=nu-system,magic-blue=nu-blue,magic-dark=nu-blue,magic-gray=nu-gray,magic-light=nu-gray"
